<title>USA: GKN approves 825,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>GKN approves 825,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>GKN Holding Corp said Monday its directors approved the buyback of 825,000 shares, or 10 percent of the company's outstanding stock.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that based on our recently released fiscal year earnings of $0.89, our stock at a price of $6.00 is very inexpensive,&quot; said GKN chairman and chief executive David Nussbaum.  &quot;We intend to periodically repurchase shares on the open market as the price and supply dictate,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
